ertical, radial or angular gradient with either 2 colors or a palette.","idstring":"A401","name":"Gradient","presets":[{"id":1795072053239,"name":"Banding Test - Gray"},{"id":1795072053240,"name":"Banding Test - Green"},{"id":1795072053241,"name":"Delta Sun"},{"id":1795072053242,"name":"Dutch Sky"},{"id":1795072053243,"name":"Smooth Edges"},{"id":1795072053244,"name":"Vignette"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Sample FFGL Gradients plugin","idstring":"RS01","name":"Gradient Example","presets":[]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\usb#vid_13d3&pid_56ff&mi_00#6&499fed6&0&0000#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\global_Integrated Camera","name":"Integrated Camera","presets":[]},{"category":"Wire Sources","description":"","idstring":"6b2ecb70-54d2-4e58-86a6-a8d8b90a6d07","name":"Layered Gradient Wave","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Branching light/lightning rays that run from left to right (volleys, chevron), glow after and fray out","idstring":"VJLR","name":"Light Ray","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A wavey line scape with adjustable wobble and jagginess.","idstring":"P204","name":"Line Scape","presets":[{"id":1795072053247,"name":"Dancing In The Dark"},{"id":1795072053248,"name":"Harp Strings"},{"id":1795072053249,"name":"Lasers"},{"id":1795072053250,"name":"Line Wobble"},{"id":1795072053251,"name":"Sand Dunes"},{"id":1795072053252,"name":"Water Fall"},{"id":1795072053253,"name":"Waving Ribbons"}]},{"category":"Wire Sources","description":"A Wire video Source needs to have at least one texture output node. \nPatch Category needs to be set to \"Source\" in the patch settings.","idstring":"7b2432b0-7939-4c0e-8d68-9692b2b505b0","name":"Line flasher","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A lines pattern with adjustable width, color, rotation and sharpness.","idstring":"P201","name":"Lines","presets":[{"id":1795072053245,"name":"45 Degree Pan"},{"id":1795072053246,"name":"Neon Up"}]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\usb#vid_046d&pid_0843&mi_00#8&380ade71&0&0000#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\global_Logitech Webcam C930e","name":"Logitech Webcam C930e","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Metaballs are soft, blobby shapes that blend into each other when they get close, like drops of water merging.","idstring":"844752396506092017","name":"Metaballs","presets":[{"id":1795072053254,"name":"Gummy"},{"id":1795072053255,"name":"Micro encounters"},{"id":1795072053256,"name":"Red cells"},{"id":1795072053257,"name":"Virus"}]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\root#media#0002#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\vidsource0_NDI Webcam Video 1","name":"NDI Webcam Video 1","presets":[]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\root#media#0002#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\vidsource1_NDI Webcam Video 2","name":"NDI Webcam Video 2","presets":[]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\root#media#0002#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\vidsource2_NDI Webcam Video 3","name":"NDI Webcam Video 3","presets":[]},{"category":"Capture Devices","description":"Capture Device Description","idstring":"DirectShow_\\\\?\\root#media#0002#{65e8773d-8f56-11d0-a3b9-00a0c9223196}\\vidsource3_NDI Webcam Video 4","name":"NDI Webcam Video 4","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Sample FFGL Particles plugin","idstring":"RS02","name":"Particles Exampl","presets":[]},{"category":"Wire Sources","description":"","idstring":"f4aa9bcf-3168-4a99-a888-7db4d8d97241","name":"Perspex Voronoi","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A multi-layered ring shape with multiple styles.","idstring":"8642267115","name":"Rings","presets":[{"id":1795072053258,"name":"3 Some"},{"id":1795072053259,"name":"Animate"},{"id":1795072053260,"name":"FireFlies"},{"id":1795072053261,"name":"Flappy Bird"},{"id":1795072053262,"name":"Light House"},{"id":1795072053263,"name":"Near Misses"},{"id":1795072053264,"name":"Radar"},{"id":1795072053265,"name":"Saw"},{"id":1795072053266,"name":"Sparkles"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Shaper","idstring":"7946640550597690042","name":"Shaper","presets":[{"id":1795072053267,"name":"Identity Crisis"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Generates a modulatable sine wave shape with control over many parameters such as frequency and modulation depth.","idstring":"9011349750094602","name":"Sine Wave","presets":[{"id":1795072053268,"name":"Curvacious"},{"id":1795072053269,"name":"Dancing windows"},{"id":1795072053270,"name":"Habichuelas"},{"id":1795072053271,"name":"Hair dance"},{"id":1795072053272,"name":"In the clouds"},{"id":1795072053273,"name":"Kisses"},{"id":1795072053274,"name":"Lava lamp"},{"id":1795072053275,"name":"Phantom signal"},{"id":1795072053276,"name":"River"},{"id":1795072053277,"name":"Rorschach"},{"id":1795072053278,"name":"Spain"},{"id":1795072053279,"name":"Waterflow"},{"id":1795072053280,"name":"x1"},{"id":1795072053281,"name":"x2"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Traces an image with one continuous pen stroke that animates like a snake","idstring":"VJSL","name":"SingleLineDraw","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"The most basic slice outliner. Go ahead and add your own fancy features!","idstring":"c_836fccea-9223-4b4e-9af5-dd76380c85ea","name":"Slice Outline","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"","idstring":"c_34c5516c-7a35-461a-bcd5-8b05edabc91c","name":"Slice Snake","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Generates a clip with a single color.","idstring":"A403","name":"Solid Color","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A bloom of the spectrum. Each frequency band throws a coloured ray as far out as it is loud, an audio steered current carries the ink away from the centre, and the frame folds into five slowly turning sectors. Amount and Trail set how much ink is laid down and how long it lingers, Hue and Spread place the palette on the colour wheel, Flow and Swirl set how fast and how wildly the current moves, Swing sets how far the music is allowed to steer it, and the Kaleido group sets how much of the fold is kept, how many sectors and rings it is cut into, and how fast it turns.","idstring":"c_e37bbe17-a1a8-4796-afd3-b533fa6444fd","name":"Spectral Bloom","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Still dark water struck by the music. A real wave equation runs under the picture: every onset drops a ring, the rings expand, reflect off the walls and interfere. Bass hits drop a wide ring near the middle, mids and highs scatter smaller ones further out, and the surface is drawn from its own curvature, so a thin bright line rides exactly on each wavefront. Each band and the strike threshold judge themselves against their own recent peak, so quiet material rings the tank as surely as loud. Speed and Stillness set how fast the water carries and how long it rings. Colors Low, Mid and High are the colors the bass, middle and treble ripples take, and Range sets how far apart they pull: at zero every ripple is Mid and the pool is tinted from that one swatch, as it was before.","idstring":"c_d4fde4d5-7cfc-43a5-9969-c3bce96dc2d5","name":"Spectral Drops","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"An audio reactive eclipse. Each frequency band throws a ray out from behind a dark disc, as far as that band is loud, while a bright limb burns on the edge of the disc and the whole corona turns slowly and trails behind itself. Reach sets how far the rays carry, Eclipse the size of the disc, Sharpness how hard its edge is and Limb how thick the burning ring is, Detail how finely each ray is feathered. Hue and Spread place the palette on the colour wheel.","idstring":"c_fc5e9263-52b3-4e2f-aa26-f6356d2945f2","name":"Spectral Eclipse","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Generative source that creates audio reactive circles and offers various options to animate or react to FFT audio signals.","idstring":"c_57112e07-cd1b-4e85-ad3e-e04007758136","name":"Spectral Shape","presets":[{"id":1795072055665,"name":"Color Cog Wheels"},{"id":1795072055666,"name":"Floating Circles"},{"id":1795072055667,"name":"Hex Tunnel"},{"id":1795072055668,"name":"Subtle Imperfection"},{"id":1795072055669,"name":"Triangular"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"","idstring":"c_ada78047-cb28-4c0e-8de4-1b29803e8b94","name":"Spectrum Visualizer","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Time to hypnotize your audience!","idstring":"884102460919","name":"Spiral","presets":[{"id":1795072053282,"name":"Minimal"},{"id":1795072053283,"name":"Outerscope"},{"id":1795072053284,"name":"Propeller"},{"id":1795072053285,"name":"Radial emissions"},{"id":1795072053286,"name":"Revolutions"},{"id":1795072053287,"name":"Sea dizyness"},{"id":1795072053288,"name":"Solar eclipse"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A Static Noise Generator.","idstring":"MSTS","name":"Static","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"A strobe generator with adjustable frequency.","idstring":"MSTR","name":"Stroboscope","presets":[{"id":1795072053289,"name":"Fast"},{"id":1795072053290,"name":"Heartbeat"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Test Card","idstring":"9114371295504994","name":"Test Card","presets":[]},{"category":"Wire Sources","description":"","idstring":"bdc732df-738b-4006-ac0c-0f8321c967a4","name":"Tex1","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Creates an animated text clip. Allows for the animation of characters, lines, words or the entire text block.","idstring":"11421072728336491440","name":"Text Animator","presets":[{"id":1795072053291,"name":"Countdown from 10 with fade"},{"id":1795072053292,"name":"Countdown from 10"},{"id":1795072053293,"name":"Dangle"},{"id":1795072053294,"name":"Flickr"},{"id":1795072053295,"name":"One Shot"},{"id":1795072053296,"name":"Type On & Off"},{"id":1795072053297,"name":"Wave"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Draws your text to the screen. Great for labels, names or mid-show poetry.","idstring":"3600113141201236715","name":"Text Block","presets":[]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Generates a fluid circular tunnel.","idstring":"c_7312a083-7086-48df-9619-081fb81b456a","name":"Tunnelines","presets":[{"id":1795072055676,"name":"Doughnut"},{"id":1795072055677,"name":"Left & Right"},{"id":1795072055678,"name":"Nauseating"},{"id":1795072055679,"name":"Spinnin"},{"id":1795072055680,"name":"Spiraling Heart"},{"id":1795072055681,"name":"Wormhole"}]},{"category":"Video Sources","description":"Reroutes the output from any other layer or group to the Video Router, allowing you to patch video signals between layers. Useful for creating modular setups without duplicating content. Defaults to rerouting the layer below.","idstring":"COMPOSITION_ROUTER_SRC","name":"Video Router","presets":[]},{"category":"Wire Sources","description":"","idstring":"6659335a-8aea-4ce9-b5b7-72aa1dc180d5","name":"X1","presets":[]}]}},"t_ms":215.54309999999998}
